    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"../EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a> given <a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>, <a href=\"../EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>、<a href=\"../EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector.ProjectionPredicate</code></a> 以及\n<a href=\"../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"../EntityProjectionIntrospector.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>EntityProjectionIntrospector</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a> that adds support to use <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a>-annotated methods on a projection interface\nto evaluate the contained SpEL expression to define the outcome of the method call.",
      "translation": "一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a>，它支持在投影接口上使用带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> 注解的方法，以评估所包含的 SpEL 表达式来定义方法调用的结果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../../repository/query/ReturnedType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ReturnedType</code></a> for the given returned type, domain type and <a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的返回类型、域类型和<a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"../../repository/query/ReturnedType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ReturnedType</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../../repository/query/RepositoryQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>RepositoryQuery</code></a> from the given <a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethod</code></a> that can be executed afterwards.",
      "translation": "从给定的<a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethod.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的\"><code>QueryMethod</code></a>解析出可随后执行的<a href=\"../../repository/query/RepositoryQuery.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 接口中的\"><code>RepositoryQuery</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 3.5, use <a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethod.html#%3Cinit%3E(java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata,org.springframework.data.projection.ProjectionFactory,java.util.function.Function)\"><code>QueryMethod(Method, RepositoryMetadata, ProjectionFactory, Function)</code></a>\n            instead.",
      "translation": "自 3.5 版本起，请使用 <a href=\"../../repository/query/QueryMethod.html#%3Cinit%3E(java.lang.reflect.Method,org.springframework.data.repository.core.RepositoryMetadata,org.springframework.data.projection.ProjectionFactory,java.util.function.Function)\"><code>QueryMethod(Method, RepositoryMetadata, ProjectionFactory, Function)</code></a> 替代。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"../ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.projection 中的接口\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
